brian nevada's vaccination rollout began  more than a month ago and our state  continues to lag behind  in vaccinating nevadans the i-team's  vanessa murphy has been trying to find  out why  the number of doses nevada is receiving  from the federal government  is much lower than other states and we  don't have  a clear answer why leaders of the  vaccination program here say  they don't know why either as of this  afternoon the cdc reports nevada second  to last in doses received from the  federal government  for every 100 000 people we're receiving  more than  11 000 doses but take a look at alaska  one of the least  populated states it's at the top with  more than  26 000 doses per 100 000 people  as we reported on january 24th governor  steve siselek sent a letter to the u.s  department of health and human services  asking for clarification about why  nevada is getting such a  low number of covid 19 vaccination doses  the kovid 19 response director says his  team is continuing to work with the  biden administration  there was a call this morning with  governors but again  still no clear answer why we  at the program level had made the  request  through our cdc uh project officer  and so we have not received the actual  formula at the program level  but i do know you know with the support  of our federal delegation they have  been asking a lot of questions the  i-team reached out to fema to find out  more and  twice a representative referred us back  to nevada  also lags behind in getting doses into  the arms of nevadans  here in clark county we're still in the  70 and over age group for the general  population lane  i asked what needs to happen to speed  this up  again the state continues to blame the  federal government  while we have many doses reported not  yet  used more on that coming up at 6.  vanessa murphy 8 news now  also a warning from nevada's vaccination  team beware of scams  only provide information to your health  care provider  or the health department you will not be  charged for the coven 19 vaccine but  your insurance  may be built
 

